                            text " but HTML 3.0 did not succeed for several reasons. The draft was considered very large at 150" 174 11642 604 16 serif 16
                          line 48 11660 744 20 base 14
                            text "pages and the pace of browser development, as well as the number of interested parties, had outstripped the" 48 11662 704 16 serif 16
