                            text ".) These included extensions to control stylistic aspects of documents, contrary to the \"belief [of the" 80 11722 656 16 serif 16
                          line 48 11740 744 20 base 14
                            text "academic engineering community] that such things as text color, background texture, font size, and font face were" 48 11742 744 16 serif 16
                          line 48 11760 744 20 base 14
                            text "definitely outside the scope of a language when their only intent was to specify how a document would be" 48 11762 692 16 serif 16
                          line 48 11780 744 20 base 14
