                            text "Although its syntax closely resembles that of " 48 12110 296 16 serif 16
                            text "SGML" 344 12110 36 16 serif 16 underline link 472
                            text ", " 380 12110 8 16 serif 16
                            text "HTML5" 388 12110 44 16 serif 16 underline link 473
                            text " has abandoned any attempt to be an SGML application" 432 12110 356 16 serif 16
                          line 48 12128 744 20 base 14
                            text "and has explicitly defined its own \"html\" serialization, in addition to an alternative XML-based XHTML5" 48 12130 672 16 serif 16
