                        block dd 48 12188 744 120
                          line 48 12188 744 20 base 14
                            text "On 14 February 2011, the W3C extended the charter of its HTML Working Group with clear milestones for HTML5. In" 48 12190 724 16 serif 16
                          line 48 12208 744 20 base 14
                            text "May 2011, the working group advanced HTML5 to \"Last Call\", an invitation to communities inside and outside W3C" 48 12210 736 16 serif 16
                          line 48 12228 744 20 base 14
                            text "to confirm the technical soundness of the specification. The W3C developed a comprehensive test suite to achieve" 48 12230 744 16 serif 16
                          line 48 12248 744 20 base 14
                            span span 704 12252 7 13
                            span span 720 12252 7 13
                            span span 704 12252 23 13
                            span a 704 12252 23 13 link 475
                            span sup 704 12252 23 13
                            text "broad interoperability for the full specification by 2014, which was the target date for recommendation." 48 12250 656 16 serif 16
                            text "[" 704 12252 7 13 serif 13 underline link 475
                            text "51" 711 12252 9 13 serif 13 underline link 475
                            text "]" 720 12252 7 13 serif 13 underline link 475
                            text " In" 727 12250 20 16 serif 16
                          line 48 12268 744 20 base 14
                            text "January 2011, the WHATWG renamed its \"HTML5\" living standard to \"HTML\". The W3C nevertheless continued its" 48 12270 724 16 serif 16
                          line 48 12288 744 20 base 14
                            span span 212 12292 7 13
                            span span 232 12292 6 13
                            span span 212 12292 26 13
                            span a 212 12292 26 13 link 476
                            span sup 212 12292 26 13
                            text "project to release HTML5." 48 12290 164 16 serif 16
                            text "[" 212 12292 7 13 serif 13 underline link 476
                            text "52" 219 12292 13 13 serif 13 underline link 476
                            text "]" 232 12292 6 13 serif 13 underline link 476
