                            line 48 12722 744 20 base 14
                              text "republished on August 1, 2002. It offers the same three variations as HTML 4.0 and 4.01, reformulated in XML, with" 48 12724 732 16 serif 16
                            line 48 12742 744 20 base 14
                              text "minor restrictions." 48 12744 116 16 serif 16
