                      block p 8 14061 784 40
                        line 8 14061 784 20 base 14
                          span span 632 14063 8 16
                          span span 640 14063 8 16
                          span span 648 14063 8 16
                          span code 632 14063 24 16
                          span span 756 14063 16 16
                          span span 772 14063 8 16
                          span span 780 14063 8 16
                          span code 756 14063 32 16
                          text "In the simple, general case, the extent of an element is indicated by a pair of tags: a \"start tag\" " 8 14063 624 16 serif 16
                          text "<" 632 14063 8 16 mono 16
                          text "p" 640 14063 8 16 mono 16
                          text ">" 648 14063 8 16 mono 16
                          text " and \"end tag\" " 656 14063 100 16 serif 16
                          text "</" 756 14063 16 16 mono 16
                          text "p" 772 14063 8 16 mono 16
                          text ">" 780 14063 8 16 mono 16
                          text "." 788 14063 4 16 serif 16
                        line 8 14081 784 20 base 14
                          text "The text content of the element, if any, is placed between these tags." 8 14083 448 16 serif 16
                      block p 8 14117 784 40
                        line 8 14117 784 20 base 14
                          text "Tags may also enclose further tag markup between the start and end, including a mixture of tags and text. This indicates" 8 14119 780 16 serif 16
                        line 8 14137 784 20 base 14
                          text "further (nested) elements, as children of the parent element." 8 14139 392 16 serif 16
                      block p 8 14173 784 80
                        line 8 14173 784 20 base 14
                          span i 300 14175 60 16
                          text "The start tag may also include the element's " 8 14175 292 16 serif 16
                          text "attributes" 300 14175 60 16 serif 16 italic
                          text " within the tag. These indicate other information, such as" 360 14175 368 16 serif 16
                        line 8 14193 784 20 base 14
                          text "identifiers for sections within the document, identifiers used to bind style information to the presentation of the document," 8 14195 784 16 serif 16
                        line 8 14213 784 20 base 14
                          span span 208 14215 8 16
                          span span 216 14215 24 16
                          span span 240 14215 8 16
                          span code 208 14215 40 16
                          text "and for some tags such as the " 8 14215 200 16 serif 16
                          text "<" 208 14215 8 16 mono 16
                          text "img" 216 14215 24 16 mono 16
                          text ">" 240 14215 8 16 mono 16
                          text " used to embed images, the reference to the image resource in the format like this:" 248 14215 532 16 serif 16
                        line 8 14233 784 20 base 14
                          span span 8 14235 8 16
                          span span 16 14235 24 16
                          span span 48 14235 24 16
                          span span 72 14235 8 16
                          span span 80 14235 200 16
                          span span 280 14235 8 16
                          span code 8 14235 280 16
                          text "<" 8 14235 8 16 mono 16
                          text "img" 16 14235 24 16 mono 16
                          text " " 40 14235 8 16 mono 16
                          text "src" 48 14235 24 16 mono 16
                          text "=" 72 14235 8 16 mono 16
                          text "\"example.com/example.jpg\"" 80 14235 200 16 mono 16
                          text ">" 280 14235 8 16 mono 16
                      block p 8 14269 784 40
                        line 8 14269 784 20 base 14
                          span a 196 14271 64 16 link 516
                          span span 264 14271 8 16
                          span span 272 14271 16 16
                          span span 288 14271 8 16
                          span code 264 14271 32 16
                          span i 388 14271 24 16
                          text "Some elements, such as the " 8 14271 188 16 serif 16
                          text "line break" 196 14271 64 16 serif 16 underline link 516
                          text " " 260 14271 4 16 serif 16
                          text "<" 264 14271 8 16 mono 16
                          text "br" 272 14271 16 16 mono 16
                          text ">" 288 14271 8 16 mono 16
                          text " do not permit " 296 14271 92 16 serif 16
                          text "any" 388 14271 24 16 serif 16 italic
                          text " embedded content, either text or further tags. These" 412 14271 336 16 serif 16
                        line 8 14289 784 20 base 14
                          text "require only a single empty tag (akin to a start tag) and do not use an end tag." 8 14291 508 16 serif 16
                      block p 8 14325 784 60
                        line 8 14325 784 20 base 14
                          span span 596 14327 8 16
                          span span 604 14327 8 16
                          span span 612 14327 8 16
                          span code 596 14327 24 16
                          text "Many tags, particularly the closing end tag for the very commonly used paragraph element " 8 14327 588 16 serif 16
                          text "<" 596 14327 8 16 mono 16
                          text "p" 604 14327 8 16 mono 16
                          text ">" 612 14327 8 16 mono 16
                          text ", are optional. An HTML" 620 14327 148 16 serif 16
                        line 8 14345 784 20 base 14
                          text "browser or other agent can infer the closure for the end of an element from the context and the structural rules defined by" 8 14347 776 16 serif 16
                        line 8 14365 784 20 base 14
                          text "the HTML standard. These rules are complex and not widely understood by most HTML authors." 8 14367 616 16 serif 16
                      block p 8 14401 784 120
