                          text "tag or the inline " 8 14463 104 16 serif 16
                          text "<" 112 14463 8 16 mono 16
                          text "img" 120 14463 24 16 mono 16
                          text ">" 144 14463 8 16 mono 16
                          text " tag. The name of an HTML element is the name used in the tags. The end tag's name is preceded" 152 14463 632 16 serif 16
