                              span code 76 16524 16 16
                              text "The " 48 16524 28 16 serif 16
                              text "id" 76 16524 16 16 mono 16
                              text " attribute provides a document-wide unique identifier for an element. This is used to identify the element so" 92 16524 696 16 serif 16
                            line 48 16542 744 20 base 14
                              text "that stylesheets can alter its presentational properties, and scripts may alter, animate or delete its contents or" 48 16544 708 16 serif 16
                            line 48 16562 744 20 base 14
                              text "presentation. Appended to the URL of the page, it provides a globally unique identifier for the element, typically a" 48 16564 724 16 serif 16
                            line 48 16582 744 20 base 14
                              text "sub-section of the page. For example, the ID \"Attributes\" in" 48 16584 388 16 serif 16
                            line 48 16602 744 20 base 14
