                    block p 8 23574 784 80
                      line 8 23574 784 20 base 14
                        span a 8 23576 64 16 link 654
                        span i 132 23576 192 16
                        text "WYSIWYG" 8 23576 64 16 serif 16 underline link 654
                        text " editors (" 72 23576 60 16 serif 16
                        text "what you see is what you get" 132 23576 192 16 serif 16 italic
                        text "), are HTML editors in which the user lays out everything as it is to" 324 23576 432 16 serif 16
                      line 8 23594 784 20 base 14
                        span a 256 23596 152 16 link 655
                        span a 516 23596 128 16 link 656
                        span a 752 23596 32 16 link 657
                        text "appear in the HTML document using a " 8 23596 248 16 serif 16
                        text "graphical user interface" 256 23596 152 16 serif 16 underline link 655
                        text " (GUI), such as " 408 23596 108 16 serif 16
                        text "Microsoft FrontPage" 516 23596 128 16 serif 16 underline link 656
                        text ", often similar to " 644 23596 108 16 serif 16
                        text "word" 752 23596 32 16 serif 16 underline link 657
                      line 8 23614 784 20 base 14
                        span a 8 23616 72 16 link 657
                        text "processors" 8 23616 72 16 serif 16 underline link 657
                        text ". The editor renders the document rather than showing the code, so authors do not require extensive" 80 23616 644 16 serif 16
                      line 8 23634 784 20 base 14
                        text "knowledge of HTML." 8 23636 132 16 serif 16
                    block p 8 23670 784 40
                      line 8 23670 784 20 base 14
                        span span 324 23674 7 13
                        span span 344 23674 6 13
                        span span 324 23674 26 13
                        span a 324 23674 26 13 link 658
                        span sup 324 23674 26 13
                        span span 350 23674 7 13
                        span span 373 23674 6 13
                        span span 350 23674 29 13
                        span a 350 23674 29 13 link 659
                        span sup 350 23674 29 13
                        text "The WYSIWYG editing model has been criticized," 8 23672 316 16 serif 16
                        text "[" 324 23674 7 13 serif 13 underline link 658
                        text "99" 331 23674 13 13 serif 13 underline link 658
                        text "]" 344 23674 6 13 serif 13 underline link 658
                        text "[" 350 23674 7 13 serif 13 underline link 659
                        text "100" 357 23674 16 13 serif 13 underline link 659
                        text "]" 373 23674 6 13 serif 13 underline link 659
                        text " primarily because of the low quality of the generated code;" 379 23672 384 16 serif 16
                      line 8 23690 784 20 base 14
                        span a 376 23692 68 16 link 660
                        span i 500 23692 208 16
                        span span 720 23694 7 13
                        span span 740 23694 6 13
                        span span 720 23694 26 13
                        span a 720 23694 26 13 link 661
                        span sup 720 23694 26 13
                        text "there are various developers advocating a change to the " 8 23692 368 16 serif 16
                        text "WYSIWYM" 376 23692 68 16 serif 16 underline link 660
                        text " model (" 444 23692 56 16 serif 16
                        text "what you see is what you mean" 500 23692 208 16 serif 16 italic
                        text ")." 708 23692 12 16 serif 16
                        text "[" 720 23694 7 13 serif 13 underline link 661
                        text "101" 727 23694 13 13 serif 13 underline link 661
                        text "]" 740 23694 6 13 serif 13 underline link 661
                    block p 8 23726 784 20
                      line 8 23726 784 20 base 14
                        text "WYSIWYG editors remain a controversial topic because of their perceived flaws such as:" 8 23728 572 16 serif 16
                    block ul 8 23762 784 160
                      block li 48 23762 744 40
                        line 48 23762 744 20 base 14
                          text "Relying mainly on the layout as opposed to meaning, often using markup that does not convey the intended" 48 23764 696 16 serif 16
                        line 48 23782 744 20 base 14
                          span span 296 23786 7 13
                          span span 319 23786 6 13
                          span span 296 23786 29 13
                          span a 296 23786 29 13 link 662
                          span sup 296 23786 29 13
                          text "meaning but simply copies the layout." 48 23784 248 16 serif 16
                          text "[" 296 23786 7 13 serif 13 underline link 662
                          text "102" 303 23786 16 13 serif 13 underline link 662
                          text "]" 319 23786 6 13 serif 13 underline link 662
                        marker "• " 36 23764 12 16
                      block li 48 23802 744 40
                        line 48 23802 744 20 base 14
                          text "Often producing extremely verbose and redundant code that fails to make use of the cascading nature of HTML and" 48 23804 740 16 serif 16
                        line 48 23822 744 20 base 14
                          span a 48 23824 24 16 link 663
                          text "CSS" 48 23824 24 16 serif 16 underline link 663
                          text "." 72 23824 4 16 serif 16
                        marker "• " 36 23804 12 16
                      block li 48 23842 744 40
                        line 48 23842 744 20 base 14
                          span a 352 23844 56 16 link 664
                          span span 692 23844 8 16
                          span span 700 23844 16 16
                          span span 716 23844 8 16
                          span code 692 23844 32 16
                          text "Often producing ungrammatical markup, called " 48 23844 304 16 serif 16
                          text "tag soup" 352 23844 56 16 serif 16 underline link 664
                          text " or semantically incorrect markup (such as " 408 23844 284 16 serif 16
                          text "<" 692 23844 8 16 mono 16
                          text "em" 700 23844 16 16 mono 16
                          text ">" 716 23844 8 16 mono 16
                          text " for" 724 23844 20 16 serif 16
                        line 48 23862 744 20 base 14
                          text "italics)." 48 23864 52 16 serif 16
                        marker "• " 36 23844 12 16
                      block li 48 23882 744 40
                        line 48 23882 744 20 base 14
                          text "As a great deal of the information in HTML documents is not in the layout, the model has been criticized for its" 48 23884 708 16 serif 16
                        line 48 23902 744 20 base 14
